  "IDAES_amendment_2": {
   "spec": "docs/derivations/S03-spec.md §18",
   "registered_unchanged": "tool_settings.IDAES: linear_solver, tol, constr_viol_tol, max_iter and smooth_vle for every solve that decides (the final solve and its accuracy rerun); converged iff 'Optimal Solution Found'",
   "common_start": [
    "S1 initial guesses: every tray inlet that is not a case inlet at the registered linear profile (320 K at stage 1 to 400 K at stage N; a liquid inlet at the profile temperature of the stage above, a vapour inlet at that of the stage below), 1 mol/s, the first inlet's composition, the registered pressure",
    "S2 initializers: L1/L2 TrayColumn.initialize(); L3 IDAES's unit initializers in TrayColumn.initialize's order (trays holding a case inlet, then the end units from the nearest of them, then every other tray from its nearest initialized neighbours)",
    "S3 one full model solve with IDAES's initializer solver (get_solver(), MUMPS, IDAES's other defaults); its final iterate is the start of the position's solves whatever its termination",
    "S4 S1-S3 run at IDAES's default SmoothVLE eps (eps_1 = 0.01 K, eps_2 = 5e-4 K)",
    "S5 an L2(b) equation on another stage's variables is deactivated during S2, with the native variable it replaces fixed at IDAES's own initial value, and restored before S3",
