    }
   ],
   "order": "levels L1, L2, L3 (each only if structurally expressible); within a level every position P0, P1, P2 is run before the level is judged, and every position whose final solve ends 'Optimal Solution Found' also gets its accuracy rerun; the search stops at the first level that passes",
